TEARDOWN
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The oracle tears down (kill + down) each profile after its probes; no pcb-rexml containers
remain. Final teardown of case images + skopeo-loaded bases:
  PCB_FLAG=teardown DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0 docker compose --profile v0 --profile v1 --profile v2 \
      down -v --rmi all
  docker image prune -f
  docker rmi ruby:2.1.3-official ruby:2.1.5-official   (ruby:2.1.4-official kept only if needed)
Case dir holds TEXT only (source recipe + oracle + payloads); no images or vendored trees.
